    options: ["Acknowledge the family's request, rapidly assess wound urgency at the bedside, call the supervisor immediately for accommodation routing, and document both the preference and the clinical findings.", "Respect the family's preference completely by leaving the home and messaging the office to reschedule with a different clinician.", "Proceed with wound care because clinical urgency overrides accommodation requests when deterioration is present.", "Ask the family to sign a refusal form first, then determine next steps based on available staffing."],
